\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O BREAD to pilgrims given,
\par O food that angels eat,
\par O Manna sent from heaven,
\par For heaven-born natures meet,
\par Give us, for Thee long pining,
\par To eat till richly filled;
\par Till, earth's delights risigning,
\par Our every wish is stilled.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O Water, life bestowing,
\par Forth from the Saviour's heart,
\par A fountain purely flowing,
\par A fount of love Thou art:
\par O let us, freely tasting,
\par Our burning thirst assuage;
\par Thy sweetness, never wasting,
\par Avails from age to age.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, this feast receiving,
\par We Thee unseen adore;
\par Thy faithful word believing,
\par We take, and doubt no more:
\par Give us, Thou true and loving,
\par On earth to live in Thee;
\par Then, death the veil removing,
\par Thy glorious face to see. Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

